[{"type":"message","user":"UMZR0QVMJ","text":"\u003c@UMZR0QVMJ\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1615635713.023500","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"92f11d81-5971-4473-9b3d-cc71ca8e64d0","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"どうやら reset.css はいくつか派生があるみたいですね。\n\u003chttps://meyerweb.com/eric/tools/css/reset/\u003e\nこちらが本家本元になります","ts":"1615562825.023200","attachments":[{"fallback":"meyerweb.com","id":1,"title":"meyerweb.com","title_link":"https://meyerweb.com/eric/tools/css/reset/","text":"The web home of Eric A. Meyer, CSS guy; and his wife Kathryn, doctor of nursing.","thumb_url":"https://meyerweb.com/ui/i/heart/663399love.png","blocks":null,"service_name":"meyerweb.com","service_icon":"https://meyerweb.com/favicon.ico","thumb_width":1024,"thumb_height":1024,"from_url":"https://meyerweb.com/eric/tools/css/reset/","original_url":"https://meyerweb.com/eric/tools/css/reset/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xWUM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7dfc7373-f8bf-405a-a603-1516ee548d40","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"マージンなどは全部 0 になったっぽい","ts":"1615562714.022500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nI91"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3cc8814-b558-47c9-8ed6-d9f8d8425d15","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"上の reset ためしたところフォントサイズはリセットされませんでした","ts":"1615562704.022200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QPDS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bed661c1-b432-4bd2-b6be-28caad16afc9","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"reset.css は全部の値をリセットするので一番強いです。わかりやすい例で言うと、h1,h2,h3,,,p などのフォントサイズが全部同じになります。好きな人は好きです。\nnormalize.css は正規化なので、h1, h2, h3 のフォントサイズは h1 が一番大きいなどの基本的なことは変わらないという感じです。\nなので、なんとなく揃えたい場合は normalize.css で、全部自分で書き直したい場合は reset.css って感じですね。","ts":"1615562625.021700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DRA3j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"192554be-299d-41b4-a102-eac8a35068fb","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"なるほど","ts":"1615562422.018400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kTBT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6228297d-68a8-47be-b932-580a38c3e67a","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"ブラウザデフォルトCSSのブラウザ間の差を失くすCSSだと、normalize.cssが一番使われているかと思います。\nCSS自体は、2年前からさほど仕様の追加はないので、更新がなくても問題はないはずです。","ts":"1615562399.017600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruho","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","U78A6ESHM","U06ECBRTJ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/x8mr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27ebb9fb-9d73-4a16-af5c-55e41c3dfe83","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"世界 TOP10 に入る複雑な OSS だと思っている","ts":"1615561574.015500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"INiQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bac9c9f1-72c9-448e-ada8-4e81cc4935b9","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"規模が。","ts":"1615561551.015100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fg94"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6662a34-3c2a-4930-a928-25502e4a4580","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"Web のレンダリングエンジン、実質めちゃくちゃ金持っている IT 企業しか作れないくらいになってるなあ","ts":"1615561547.014900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PtS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"56ebfbd6-1a59-42f7-95df-50f671560d46","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"\u003chttps://piccalil.li/blog/a-modern-css-reset\u003e\n教えていただいたこれ良さそうですね","ts":"1615561543.014700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qTAa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c673e9b4-e1ff-47e0-a942-bedc1716ddac","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"(Chromiumを使っての発言である)","ts":"1615561512.014100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IwEBQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"faffdbbd-a6a1-46ed-a18b-8b4c47859308","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"古いブラウザは淘汰されてほしいけど競合はあってほしいな","ts":"1615561499.013800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bzc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57c68bf9-3943-4632-a764-f096c06d12bd","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"え、そうなんですね。知らんかった。","ts":"1615561369.013500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"anb"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d6722579-0745-4309-83ca-68228bfffba3","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ほえー","ts":"1615561359.013300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vuX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1ca0636-e459-49a0-ba2c-5a6b97c5f62e","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"まぁ、みんながみんな同じだっら、ブラウザ1つでいいじゃんってなりますしね…","ts":"1615561357.013100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VL8f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6500c297-f07b-4d49-be6e-6c3b97d80d1c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"そういえば先日、旧EdgeがData URI Schemeをサポートしていないことを知りました","ts":"1615561349.012700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uogN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b570553-608c-4ab3-bfd4-6407e2a5ec58","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"WebGL の挙動も違ったなあ…","ts":"1615561330.011800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iQHn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9eac9109-2eda-4694-8bf5-bc22ad5bda15","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":":safar